# Line endings and binary files.
#
# Text files are stored in the repository with LF; on checkout every platform
# gets its own line endings (text=auto). PowerShell and batch files are checked
# out with CRLF everywhere, so that on the build VM they look the way Windows
# expects. Images, icons and recordings are binary - no conversion, no diff.
* text=auto

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.bmp binary
*.hevc binary
